sequenceDiagram
    participant Staff
    participant ReactUI
    participant ExpressAPI
    participant AppointmentService
    participant MongoDB
    participant EventHandlers
    participant GmailSMTP
    Staff->>ReactUI: Approve assigned Pending booking
    ReactUI->>ExpressAPI: PATCH approve with Bearer token
    ExpressAPI->>MongoDB: Read current user and appointment
    MongoDB-->>ExpressAPI: Active account and accessible appointment
    ExpressAPI->>AppointmentService: approve(appointmentId, actorId)
    AppointmentService->>MongoDB: Conditional Confirmed update and history
    MongoDB-->>AppointmentService: Updated appointment or conflict
    AppointmentService->>MongoDB: Confirm owned slot reservation
    MongoDB-->>AppointmentService: Reservation confirmation
    AppointmentService->>EventHandlers: Emit appointment approval event
    par Asynchronous side effects
    EventHandlers->>MongoDB: Append audit log and private notifications
    EventHandlers->>GmailSMTP: Send eligible patient confirmation
    GmailSMTP-->>EventHandlers: Accepted or failed
    EventHandlers->>MongoDB: Record delivery status and sentAt
    and Clinical response proceeds independently
    AppointmentService-->>ExpressAPI: Updated appointment
    ExpressAPI-->>ReactUI: 200 JSON success
    ReactUI-->>Staff: Updated appointment table
    end
